{"data": [{"author_id": "1852310846258786304", "created_at": "2026-10-27T22:16:11.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115205950726631449"], "entities": {"mentions": [{"end": 19, "id": "1720665183188922368", "start": 14, "username": "grok"}]}, "id": "2115205950726631449", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 22, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "预测2026中国出生人口\n\n@grok", "url": "https://x.com/quixote0619/status/2115205950726631449"}, {"author_id": "1275681834475626506", "created_at": "2026-10-29T16:18:46.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115840776316051920"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "x.com/kaptonia/statu…", "end": 73, "expanded_url": "https://twitter.com/kaptonia/status/2111573180905320482", "start": 50, "url": "https://t.co/T7scL8aVrO"}]}, "id": "2115840776316051920", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 76, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2111573180905320482", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "经济问题，能靠改革在短时间内改善\n人口问题，影响的是几十上百年\n明年回头看出生人口数据肯定会很有趣 https://t.co/T7scL8aVrO", "url": "https://x.com/Crypto_Z_S/status/2115840776316051920"}, {"author_id": "951757500746907648", "created_at": "2026-10-29T10:31:11.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115753303674101777"], "id": "2115753303674101777", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 3, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "金融危机已经在爆发了，先是房价暴跌，如今是股市暴跌。出生人口暴跌，失业人数无法估算，各行各业，每个年龄段的人都过的很累", "url": "https://x.com/xunfeipeng/status/2115753303674101777"}, {"author_id": "463665704", "created_at": "2026-10-28T03:32:36.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115285575926485127"], "id": "2115285575926485127", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 103, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "我这才知道原来外国人算大跃进死亡人数是这么瞎编的。2016年中国出生人口1700万，到了2025年只有800万，所以，2024-2026年，中国饿死了3000万。", "url": "https://x.com/ricoraygump/status/2115285575926485127"}, {"author_id": "145513718", "created_at": "2026-10-29T09:18:49.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115735095260885463"], "entities": {"hashtags": [{"end": 15, "start": 9, "tag": "麥巴比辱華"}, {"end": 120, "start": 113, "tag": "Mbappé"}, {"end": 130, "start": 121, "tag": "dictator"}, {"end": 135, "start": 131, "tag": "独裁者"}, {"end": 142, "start": 136, "tag": "毛沢東コラ"}], "mentions": [{"end": 110, "id": "10228272", "start": 102, "username": "YouTube"}], "urls": [{"description": "00:05 效力西甲皇家馬德里的法國球星麥巴比，因涉嫌發表辱華言論，被多個內地品牌「封殺」。在北京，外交部表示，對於傷害中國人民感情...", "display_url": "youtu.be/KuTvrYacUi8?si…", "end": 101, "expanded_url": "https://youtu.be/KuTvrYacUi8?si=8kugP-JJfG6L-Rnt", "images": [{"height": 360, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2115735097093869568/qjDE7kQN?format=jpg&name=orig", "width": 480}, {"height": 150, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2115735097093869568/qjDE7kQN?format=jpg&name=150x150", "width": 150}], "start": 78, "status": 200, "title": "今日兩岸新聞重點：麥巴比辱華風波　致歉指言論欠妥｜內地去年人口面臨跌穿14億　廣東續為全國出生人口最多省份｜無綫新聞｜TVB News｜2026/10/27", "unwound_url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?si=8kugP-JJfG6L-Rnt&v=KuTvrYacUi8&feature=youtu.be", "url": "https://t.co/PL5PDWKDCc"}]}, "id": "2115735095260885463", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 64, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "今日兩岸新聞重點：#麥巴比辱華 風波　致歉指言論欠妥｜內地去年人口面臨跌穿14億　廣東續為全國出生人口最多省份｜無綫新聞｜TVB News｜2026... https://t.co/PL5PDWKDCc @YouTubeより #Mbappé #dictator #独裁者　＃毛沢東コラ", "url": "https://x.com/DigiPubFlickr/status/2115735095260885463"}, {"author_id": "1416934621598474240", "created_at": "2026-10-29T20:37:10.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115905806269063421"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/eC00cDLXis", "end": 121, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/SyPuzemI2PG560O/status/2115905806269063421/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2115905800246079488", "start": 98, "url": "https://t.co/eC00cDLXis"}]}, "id": "2115905806269063421", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 16, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "31省份2025年人口出生率公布\n\n划重点：\n2025年全年，全国出生人口达792万人，出生率为5.63‰，自然增长率为-2.41‰\n这还是习贼共匪自己编出来的数字都是负数！真实情况怕是更恶略！ https://t.co/eC00cDLXis", "url": "https://x.com/SyPuzemI2PG560O/status/2115905806269063421"}, {"author_id": "166476172", "created_at": "2026-10-29T00:34:47.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115603216452800739"], "id": "2115603216452800739", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 4, "impression_count": 12619, "like_count": 37, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 3}, "text": "中国人口结构发生历史性逆转！2025年，中国65岁及以上老年人口超过2.23亿，14岁及以下儿童只有约2.13亿。中国老年人口首次超过儿童，老年抚养比也首次超过少儿抚养比。\n\n与此同时，中国全年出生人口只有792万人，死亡人口达到1131万人，人口减少339万人，比2024年多减少200万人。", "url": "https://x.com/wongkim728/status/2115603216452800739"}, {"author_id": "2068518641511911424", "created_at": "2026-10-29T06:41:40.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115695544987431141"], "id": "2115695544987431141", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 387, "like_count": 10, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 8, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "想起以前，课本里，电视新闻里，报纸上\n天天宣扬人口爆炸，粮食紧缺，石油威机。\n\n这才几年，想象中的人口爆炸不仅没发生，反而出生人口快速下降，各国政府粉粉开始出台催婚催育政策\n\n只能说盛极必衰，物极必反", "url": "https://x.com/YY6bro/status/2115695544987431141"}, {"author_id": "1018409030727815168", "created_at": "2026-10-28T16:45:37.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115485148204683612"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "x.com/peter90116/sta…", "end": 116, "expanded_url": "https://twitter.com/peter90116/status/2115479957577080894", "start": 93, "url": "https://t.co/DcqAD41i1r"}]}, "id": "2115485148204683612", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 519, "like_count": 2, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2115479957577080894", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "师医公（当然这里说的是外围公）各自有缓慢的崩解过程，医疗部门有可见的政策削减，但老师们的护城河是最低的，出生人口和待教育人口不断下滑，AI 又常常比他们讲得好，手里的议价筹码非常有限。 https://t.co/DcqAD41i1r", "url": "https://x.com/kone12185334/status/2115485148204683612"}, {"author_id": "1523638440503300096", "created_at": "2026-10-28T12:44:23.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115424439781204017"], "id": "2115424439781204017", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 129, "like_count": 2, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "国务院常务会议提出,持续完善婚嫁、生育、养育、教育等政策,在财税、社保、住房上加大对家庭的支持,努力稳定新出生人口规模。 年轻人真正关心的是\"生得起、养得起\"。政策落到房租和育儿账单上,才算落地。", "url": "https://x.com/Deep___White/status/2115424439781204017"}, {"author_id": "1170834374222155777", "created_at": "2026-10-29T13:19:41.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115795711191396680"], "id": "2115795711191396680", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 32, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "この試算だと韓国は試算出生人口上限が1200万人(現人口比 23%)だし、中国は4.9億人(現人口比 36%)。韓国に関しては3世代後には年間出生数が1万人台になる計算。\n出生率が置換水準未満のまま永久に推移するなら、の話だけど。", "url": "https://x.com/enkephalos_ghrn/status/2115795711191396680"}, {"author_id": "1627196426727079936", "created_at": "2026-10-28T10:22:39.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115388771441205629"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/nzX9YaP4Hi", "end": 133, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/ZYaolun/status/2115388771441205629/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2115388326429749248", "start": 110, "url": "https://t.co/nzX9YaP4Hi"}, {"display_url": "pic.x.com/nzX9YaP4Hi", "end": 133, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/ZYaolun/status/2115388771441205629/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2115388346184998912", "start": 110, "url": "https://t.co/nzX9YaP4Hi"}, {"display_url": "pic.x.com/nzX9YaP4Hi", "end": 133, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/ZYaolun/status/2115388771441205629/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2115388460781735936", "start": 110, "url": "https://t.co/nzX9YaP4Hi"}]}, "id": "2115388771441205629", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 36, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "做了个网页游戏《14亿分之1》：按真实出生人口，把你随机投胎到中国某个地方，从 0 岁活到 18 岁。\n\n我这局 16 岁，家传玉佩里睡了八百年的老爷爷说：“把你的身子借我三天。”\n我借了。\n然后我在玉佩里醒了过来。🧵 https://t.co/nzX9YaP4Hi", "url": "https://x.com/ZYaolun/status/2115388771441205629"}, {"author_id": "1466567119101857792", "created_at": "2026-10-29T09:13:54.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115733855692796268"], "id": "2115733855692796268", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 10, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "去年全国结婚登记676.3万对，比前一年多了65.7万对，据民政部公开统计，这算是近几年婚姻数据难得的小幅回升，不过这并不能算“结婚回暖”。同一份公开信息里，2025年出生人口792万，比2024年的954万少了162万，创下新中国成立之后的新低。", "url": "https://x.com/GouKuankuan/status/2115733855692796268"}, {"author_id": "1923698544122396677", "created_at": "2026-10-28T15:38:21.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115468218319954336"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/HmjHoh4gI6", "end": 177, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/hyi54556/status/2115468218319954336/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2115468197667262464", "start": 154, "url": "https://t.co/HmjHoh4gI6"}]}, "id": "2115468218319954336", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 16, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "2025年各省出生人口排名：\n​第10名：湖南，30多万人\n第9名：云南，30多万人\n第8名：贵州，30多万人\n第7名：广西，约36万人\n第6名：江苏，35.8万人\n第5名：浙江，35.8万人\n第4名：四川，43.4万人\n第3名：山东，51.9万人\n第2名：河南，60多万人\n第1名：广东，100.3万人！ https://t.co/HmjHoh4gI6", "url": "https://x.com/hyi54556/status/2115468218319954336"}, {"author_id": "1305905708018348032", "created_at": "2026-10-28T17:34:45.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115497510508659191"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/JvZ7tPZ6Rm", "end": 140, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/CausMoney/status/2115497510508659191/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2115497262163836928", "start": 117, "url": "https://t.co/JvZ7tPZ6Rm"}]}, "id": "2115497510508659191", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 1, "impression_count": 1059, "like_count": 2, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "中国大陆老年人口首次超过少儿人口，老年抚养比升至23.1%\n\n中国人口结构出现历史性变化。根据国家统计局最新公布的数据，2025年中国65岁及以上人口达到2.2365亿，超过14岁及以下儿童的2.1276亿，两者相差约1089万人。 https://t.co/JvZ7tPZ6Rm", "url": "https://x.com/CausMoney/status/2115497510508659191"}, {"author_id": "1587359156805439488", "created_at": "2026-10-28T10:47:21.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115394986007216465"], "id": "2115394986007216465", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 0, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "很多人可能不知道大跃进导致三千万人死亡的数字是怎么来的，竟然真的认真辩论上了，这个数字最早是从出生人口曲线里得到的，因为按照曲线来看少出生了两千多万人，随着宣传变成了大跃进导致三千万人饿死，极其荒谬，真实的死亡人数应该在两百万左右。", "url": "https://x.com/alexenr59802177/status/2115394986007216465"}, {"author_id": "1806023702934405120", "created_at": "2026-10-29T10:49:13.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115757842800234610"], "entities": {"mentions": [{"end": 5, "id": "1720665183188922368", "start": 0, "username": "grok"}], "urls": [{"display_url": "x.com/danielduquenal…", "end": 157, "expanded_url": "https://twitter.com/danielduquenal/status/2115605091994530055", "start": 134, "url": "https://t.co/82H0BL0Hil"}]}, "id": "2115757842800234610", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 1, "impression_count": 32, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2115605091994530055", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "@grok 西方媒体炒作毛泽东杀了8000万人，这个计算是不是用预期出生人口叠加死亡人口加算出来的？按这个计算维多利亚女王在整个大英帝国境内，杀了多少人？\n\n采用该算法最宽泛的超额死亡统计方法，仅维多利亚女王统治最后20年的英属印度，就能计算出约7600万超额死亡。 https://t.co/82H0BL0Hil", "url": "https://x.com/LouisWei998258/status/2115757842800234610"}, {"author_id": "1079005910746390529", "created_at": "2026-10-28T09:19:51.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115372964397093254"], "id": "2115372964397093254", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 302, "like_count": 2, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 5, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "大家有没有发现，身边的老年人比年轻人多得多了？\n\n中国现在65岁以上人口，已经达到了2.23亿，14岁以下的年轻人，只有2.13亿。\n\n老年人比孩子还多了1000万，而且老年人口的数量还会不断增加，出生人口数则是不断减少。\n\n照这样发展下去，几年以后，养老、房地产和就业市场，会变成什么样子呢？", "url": "https://x.com/ileoyeye/status/2115372964397093254"}, {"author_id": "135732488", "created_at": "2026-10-29T16:10:02.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115838578039431537"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "x.com/YeTao10993710/…", "end": 179, "expanded_url": "https://twitter.com/YeTao10993710/status/2115522856704483659", "start": 156, "url": "https://t.co/i31VOGvyum"}]}, "id": "2115838578039431537", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 6, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2115522856704483659", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "你的数据是来自于83年版《中国统计年鉴》吧？\n按照这本年鉴，1960年的出生人口约1381万人；但40年后的全国人口普查中，40岁人口却有1468万人。\n何况，这1468万人本身还已经经历了40年的疾病和意外死亡。\n如果1983年的统计年鉴上的出生率被证实是严重不准的，那么它记录的死亡率凭什么让人相信是准的？ https://t.co/i31VOGvyum", "url": "https://x.com/iviso/status/2115838578039431537"}, {"author_id": "2115266752036904960", "created_at": "2026-10-28T18:42:27.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115514550154113401"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "x.com/xingxingjiad/s…", "end": 160, "expanded_url": "https://twitter.com/xingxingjiad/status/2115469553967026567", "start": 137, "url": "https://t.co/3QI4nfOOOa"}]}, "id": "2115514550154113401", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 3, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2115469553967026567", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "毛泽东屠的多，中国人生的多啊，猜猜看为什么1963年中国出生人口这么多？这叫做灾后泛滥现象，侧面印证了大饥荒就是真实的，而毛腊肉最恶心的还是搞出大饥荒，结果彭德怀给他反映情况，直接反手把彭德怀处理了，这就是毛泽东这个畜生最贱畜的地方，饿死几千万人也不认错，还搞掉说实话的人 https://t.co/3QI4nfOOOa", "url": "https://x.com/J0hnSm1thth/status/2115514550154113401"}, {"author_id": "1378320364376219655", "created_at": "2026-10-28T09:06:00.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115369479777423389"], "id": "2115369479777423389", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 2156, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "国内人口分化越来越明显，2025年末总人口14.0489亿，离跌破14亿只差489万，不少专家预判十五五会跌破14亿，全国仅7省人口正增长。", "url": "https://x.com/WangNextDoor2/status/2115369479777423389"}, {"author_id": "2104757028547895296", "created_at": "2026-10-29T21:00:01.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115911554948313549"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/4NHNkFWpzA", "end": 156, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/0x_SunXiaomei/status/2115911554948313549/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2115868745612836865", "start": 133, "url": "https://t.co/4NHNkFWpzA"}]}, "id": "2115911554948313549", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 53, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "中国社保大概率会崩盘：\n\n1老龄化加剧，领养老金人越来越多\n 2出生人口锐减，未来缴费人口减少  3收支失衡，缴费增长赶不上支出 \n4财政压力巨大，养老金对财政补贴的依赖增加 \n5地区差异严重，部分地区养老支付压力巨大  6就业不稳定，灵活就业、低收入影响持续缴费 https://t.co/4NHNkFWpzA", "url": "https://x.com/0x_SunXiaomei/status/2115911554948313549"}, {"author_id": "1739643782768021504", "created_at": "2026-10-29T16:19:45.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115841025176670560"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/Wd565p3plk", "end": 174, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/ppmmzzcn/status/2115841025176670560/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2115840976187236352", "start": 151, "url": "https://t.co/Wd565p3plk"}]}, "id": "2115841025176670560", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 15, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "📺【B站热门】五年不见！人生一串4重磅回归最近这些年，一个很明显的变化正在悄悄发生：出生于上世纪60年代的群体，正大批量离开职场。60年代出生人口规模大约2亿人，从2020年起，1960年生人满60岁，开启退休流程，往后每年都有一大批60后到龄退出劳动力主力队伍。阅读此文之前，麻烦您点击一下“关注” https://t.co/Wd565p3plk", "url": "https://x.com/ppmmzzcn/status/2115841025176670560"}, {"author_id": "256065509", "created_at": "2026-10-28T11:20:48.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115403402536743250"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/kq64xNpeiB", "end": 157, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/aiwangupiao/status/2115403402536743250/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2115402700619980801", "start": 134, "url": "https://t.co/kq64xNpeiB"}, {"display_url": "x.com/guillaume_ggc/…", "end": 181, "expanded_url": "https://twitter.com/guillaume_ggc/status/2114425484859556287", "start": 158, "url": "https://t.co/mOrl4Yki3o"}]}, "id": "2115403402536743250", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 2, "impression_count": 5057, "like_count": 9, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 2, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2114425484859556287", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "人口才是一个国家最深层的竞争力。美国出生人口相对稳定，而中国人口出生率持续下滑，未来几十年，两国人口结构可能发生深刻变化。人口减少不仅影响消费、房地产和劳动力市场，还会影响经济增长潜力与产业发展。过去我们习惯关注GDP、科技和制造业竞争，却容易忽略人口这个长期变量。 https://t.co/kq64xNpeiB https://t.co/mOrl4Yki3o", "url": "https://x.com/aiwangupiao/status/2115403402536743250"}, {"author_id": "104791816", "created_at": "2026-10-28T20:08:11.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115536125892632881"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/E7PzahkQXQ", "end": 135, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/molihua_org/status/2115536125892632881/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2115536124319760384", "start": 112, "url": "https://t.co/E7PzahkQXQ"}]}, "id": "2115536125892632881", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 27, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "中国65岁以上人口去年首次超过少儿人口。国家统计局数据显示，去年中国0至14岁人口2.1276亿，占比15.1%；65岁及以上人口2.2365亿，占比15.9%。老年抚养比升至23.1%，历史上首次超过少儿抚养比的22%。 https://t.co/E7PzahkQXQ", "url": "https://x.com/molihua_org/status/2115536125892632881"}], "includes": {"users": [{"id": "1852310846258786304", "name": "Quixote", "username": "quixote0619"}, {"id": "1275681834475626506", "name": "韭本粥", "username": "Crypto_Z_S"}, {"id": "951757500746907648", "name": "xunfei", "username": "xunfeipeng"}, {"id": "463665704", "name": "无语了", "username": "r